#: ../../tools/allen_brain_tools.rst:32 0ce90cf3be994e1983243703a19675b7
msgid ""
"**Description**: Get gene expression experiment datasets from the Allen "
"Mouse Brain Atlas for a given gene. Returns section data sets including "
"plane of section, section thickness, and linked gene info. These datasets"
" contain ISH (in situ hybridization) gene expression images. Example: "
"'Gad1' returns 22 ISH experiment datasets."
msgstr ""

