msgid ""
"**Description**: Search for genes in the Allen Brain Atlas by gene symbol"
" (acronym) or name. Returns gene metadata including Entrez ID, "
"chromosome, homologene ID. Useful for finding gene IDs needed to query "
"expression data. Example: 'Gad1' returns glutamate decarboxylase 1 "
"records for mouse and rat."
msgstr ""

#: ../../tools/allen_brain_tools.rst:104 867be577c52a441c880b1d7600d2eb45
msgid ""
"``gene_acronym`` (string, null) (optional) Gene symbol/acronym for exact "
"match. Examples: 'Gad1', 'Pvalb', 'Sst', 'Bdnf', 'Th'."
msgstr ""

#: ../../tools/allen_brain_tools.rst:107 07e30fbb365d4b6a9d0148b2fd408b55
msgid ""
"``gene_name`` (string, null) (optional) Gene name for partial match "
"search (alternative to gene\\_acronym). Example: 'glutamate "
"decarboxylase'."
msgstr ""

